### List Projects (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

### Get Project by Slug (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/sample-project
Accept: application/json

### Create Project (auth) — stores id for reuse
@name create-project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "REST Client Test Project",
  "description": "Created via VS Code REST Client.",
  "tech_stack": ["React", "Node.js"],
  "live_url": "https://example.com",
  "repo_url": "https://github.com/example/repo",
  "published": true,
  "order": 10
}

### Update Project (auth)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{create-project.response.body.project.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "REST Client Test Project (updated)",
  "description": "Updated via VS Code REST Client.",
  "published": true
}

### Delete Project (auth)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{create-project.response.body.project.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
